    "category": "\uD802\uDD82\uD81A\uDE06\uD800\uDC2A\uD81A\uDC0B - Friends",
    "name": "tinyqv",
    "topic": "**TinyQV** by Mike Bell: a small RISC-V (RV32EC) SoC with peripherals from the Tiny Tapeout RISC-V competition, with chips on wafer.space runs.\n\n**Run 1**\n• [TQVA](https://wafer.space/ws-run1/projects/TQVA.html) (0.5x0.5 slot)\n• [TQVB](https://wafer.space/ws-run1/projects/TQVB.html) (0.5x1 slot)\n• [TQVC](https://wafer.space/ws-run1/projects/TQVC.html) (1x0.5 slot)\n**Run 2**\n• [TQVA](https://wafer.space/ws-run2/projects/TQVA.html) (0.5x0.5 slot)\n• [TQVC](https://wafer.space/ws-run2/projects/TQVC.html) (1x0.5 slot)\n• [TQVD](https://wafer.space/ws-run2/projects/TQVD.html) (HDMI output)\n• [TQVE](https://wafer.space/ws-run2/projects/TQVE.html) (experimental pad setup)\n**Source**\n• [tinyQV](https://github.com/MichaelBell/tinyQV)\n• [ws01-tinyQV](https://github.com/MichaelBell/ws01-tinyQV) (Run 1)\n• [ws02-tinyQV](https://github.com/MichaelBell/ws02-tinyQV) (Run 2)"
  },
